  "body_html": "<h1>mmsValue_le_of_forall</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma mmsValue_le_of_forall (v : Valuation N G) (allGoods : Finset G) (i : N) (hne : Nonempty {A : Allocation N G // IsAllocation allGoods A}) (ub : ℝ) (h : ∀ B : Allocation N G, IsAllocation allGoods B → iInf (fun j : N =&gt; v.val i (B j)) ≤ ub) : mmsValue v allGoods i ≤ ub</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Valuation</li>\n<li>Allocation</li>\n</ul>",
